10010103:3:2","objective_task_id":"3","objective_step_id":"2","objective_summary_source_cn":"得知梅林的加护正在衰弱，一股“火热”的魔力正在修复它，众人心中都有了思量。但当务之急是返回火灾现场，调查遗漏的线索。","objective_summary_i18n":{"cn":"得知梅林的加护正在衰弱，一股“火热”的魔力正在修复它，众人心中都有了思量。但当务之急是返回火灾现场，调查遗漏的线索。","en":"Knowing that a fervent magic force is repairing Merlin's weakening ward, everyone starts contemplating. However, the most pressing matter at the moment is to investigate the fire scene for more clues.","jp":"「灼熱」の魔力が、弱まりつつあるマーリンの「加護」を回復させていることを知って、人々は思うところがあるようだ。だが今は火事の現場に戻って、見落とした手がかりがないか調べることが先決だ。","kr":"멀린의 가호가 약해지고 있고 “불타는” 마력이 이를 복구하고 있다는 소식에 모두 생각에 잠겼다. 하지만 화재 현장으로 돌아가 사라진 단서를 찾는 것이 급선무다."},"objective_summary_status":"exact_duplicate_same","objective_summary_record_index":"43195","objective_prerequisite_stories":[],"exploration_line_id":"10010103","exploration_collection_key":"base_campaign","exploration_chapter_key":"ryeham_tales","exploration_story_kind":"main_story","exploration_evidence_source":"ExplStep.FinishAction.C_RunPlot","exploration_placement_note":"","episode_title_i18n":{"cn":"初始篇章","en":"Base Campaign","jp":"基本ストーリー","kr":"기본 캠페인"},"arc_title_i18n":{"cn":"金穗之章","en":"Ryeham Tales","jp":"金麦の章","kr":"금빛이삭의 장"},"cinematics":[{"node_id":"line:1:timeline::","timeline_name":"timeline_00_01_1010391.prefab","timeline_resource_name":"timeline_00_01_1010391","summary_text_key":"","summary_source_cn":"","summary_i18n":{},"summary_status":{},"summary_record_index":"","metadata_source":"","subtitle_count":0,"cinematic_dialogue_count":0}],"asset_key":"timeline/dialoguetree_story_1010391","asset_path":"timeline/dialoguetree_story/NodeCanvas__DialogueTree__timeline__dialoguetree_story_1010391.decoded.json","graph":"stories/timeline/dialoguetree_story/1010391.graph.json","locales":{"cn":"locales/cn/timeline/dialoguetree_story/1010391.json","en":"locales/en/timeline/dialoguetree_story/1010391.json","jp":"locales/jp/timeline/dialoguetree_story/1010391.json","kr":"locales/kr/timeline/dialoguetree_story/1010391.json"},"